Description: A suite of univariate and multivariate tools for estimating standard and detrended temporal community stability metrics and its components. Detrended versions are based on Hill's (1973) <doi:10.2307/2258930> 2 and 3 term local quadratic variance estimates. Other functions allow managing, cleaning and simulating community abundance data to be used along the rest of the package.
